      "notes": "ACRIS Real Property Master (bnx9-e6tj), Legals (8h5j-fqxa) and Parties (636b-3b5g), one SODA request per dataset per document-ID year 2013-2026 (document IDs run back to 2003; earlier years are the same request with another year) (document IDs begin with the year). Master is limited to deed, mortgage and satisfaction document types; Parties to party types 1 and 2 and to the columns document_id, party_type, name (no addresses). The Parties files name natural persons; the adapter drops them on reading and the raw files stay in the private archive. data.cityofnewyork.us robots.txt: Crawl-delay 1; only /browse search pages disallowed. The Tyler/Socrata platform terms are in tension with bulk export (see ny-nyc-dof and docs/registry/requests/platform-terms/socrata.md); the agency licence is relied on."
